---

## OpenVela 手表快应用 - 可用 API 完整参考

### 📁 文档来源

| 文件 | 说明 |
|------|------|
| [sensor.jidl](frameworks/runtimes/feature/modules/jidl/sensor.jidl) | 传感器 API 接口定义 |
| [health.jidl](frameworks/runtimes/feature/modules/jidl/health.jidl) | 健康数据 API |
| [vibrator.jidl](frameworks/runtimes/feature/modules/jidl/vibrator.jidl) | 振动器 API |
| [storage.jidl](frameworks/runtimes/feature/modules/jidl/storage.jidl) | 本地存储 API |
| [device.jidl](frameworks/runtimes/feature/modules/jidl/device.jidl) | 设备信息 API |

---

### 1. 传感器 API (`@system.sensor`)

#### 加速度计 - 姿态识别核心

```javascript
import sensor from '@system.sensor'

// 订阅加速度计数据
sensor.subscribeAccelerometer({
  interval: 'normal',  // 'game'(20ms) | 'ui'(50ms) | 'normal'(200ms)
  reserved: false,
  callback: function(data) {
    // data: { x: number, y: number, z: number }
    console.log('x:', data.x, 'y:', data.y, 'z:', data.z)
  },
  fail: function(data, code) {
    console.log('订阅失败:', code)
  }
})

// 取消订阅
sensor.unsubscribeAccelerometer()
```

**返回数据格式：**
```typescript
{
  x: number  // X轴加速度
  y: number  // Y轴加速度
  z: number  // Z轴加速度
}
```

#### 磁力计（指南针）

```javascript
sensor.subscribeCompass({
  callback: function(data) {
    // data: { direction: number, accuracy: number }
    console.log('方向:', data.direction, '精度:', data.accuracy)
  }
})
sensor.unsubscribeCompass()
```

#### 距离传感器

```javascript
sensor.subscribeProximity({
  callback: function(data) {
    // data: { distance: number }
  }
})
sensor.unsubscribeProximity()
```

#### 光线传感器

```javascript
sensor.subscribeLight({
  callback: function(data) {
    // data: { intensity: number }
  }
})
sensor.unsubscribeLight()
```

#### 气压计

```javascript
sensor.subscribePressure({
  callback: function(data) {
    // data: { pressure: number }
  }
})
sensor.unsubscribePressure()
```

#### 温度/湿度传感器

```javascript
sensor.subscribeAmbientTemperature({
  callback: function(data) {
    // data: { temperature: number }
  }
})

sensor.subscribeHumidity({
  callback: function(data) {
    // data: { humidity: number }
